      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Defy Death.</strong> You have Advantage on Death Saving Throws.</p><p><strong>Speedy Recovery.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can expend one of your Hit Point Dice, roll it, and regain Hit Points equal to the roll.</p>",
